pipeline.py:381,395 - Path traversal check uses string prefix:
  if not str(detail_path).startswith(str(details_dir.resolve()) + "/"):

Python 3.9+ has Path.is_relative_to() which is more readable and avoids
the string manipulation:
  if not detail_path.is_relative_to(details_dir.resolve()):

Functionally identical; Python ≥3.9 is already required by the project.
